## 🛠️ Setup Instructions
1. Setup MongoDB in local pointing to port 27017 otherwise update the MongoURL in .env file for the backend server application.
2. Run "npm i" in both client and server applications.
3. Run "node scripts/populate.js" inside ./server/ nodejs application to populate the data in mongoDB.
4. Start nodejs server "node server.js".
5. Start React application with "npm start".